sequenceDiagram
    participant R as dVRK arm (ROS 2)
    participant A as tool_pose_adapter / fleet_monitor
    participant B as kafka_bridge (C++)
    participant S as Schema registry
    participant K as Kafka
    participant P as Spark Structured Streaming
    participant I as Iceberg (telemetry.*)
    participant E as Elasticsearch

    B->>S: GET /subjects/{topic}-value/versions/latest (startup)
    S-->>B: schema id + Avro schema
    R->>A: measured_cp, jaw/measured_js (50 Hz)
    A->>B: rtdaas_msgs/ToolPose on /{robot}/{arm}/rtdaas/tool_pose
    B->>K: 0x00 + schema id + Avro(envelope{robot_id, ros_topic, recv_time_ns, msg})
    loop every 30 s trigger
        K->>P: micro-batch (3 topics)
        P->>P: from_avro, watermark 30 s, 1-min windows per robot × arm
        P->>I: append *_raw (source=stream), MERGE kpi_1m (stream never overwrites batch)
        P->>E: bulk upsert rtdaas-kpi-1m, rtdaas-events
    end
